@startuml TimisoaraLens App - State Diagram
!theme plain

[*] --> Splash

Splash : - Check stored token\n- Auto-login

Splash --> Unauthenticated : No token found
Splash --> Home : Token valid

Unauthenticated : - Login screen\nactive

Unauthenticated --> Register : User clicks\nregister

Register : - Registration form

Register --> Unauthenticated : Cancel or\nback button

Register --> Home : Registration\nsuccess

Unauthenticated --> Home : Login\nsuccess

Home : - Authenticated\n- Main menu

Home --> ViewListings : Click "Apartamente"

Home --> Logout : Click logout

Logout --> Unauthenticated : Token cleared

ViewListings : - List of apartments\n- Pull to refresh

ViewListings --> Home : Back button

ViewListings --> ViewDetail : Click apartment

ViewDetail : - Single listing\ndetails\n- Display reviews\n- Authenticated users can add review

ViewDetail --> Home : Back

ViewDetail --> ViewReviews : Click "See all reviews"

ViewReviews : - List of all reviews\n- Rating statistics\n- User comments

ViewReviews --> ViewDetail : Back

ViewDetail --> AddReview : Click "Add Review"\n(if authenticated)

AddReview : - Review form\n- Star rating\n- Title & comment

AddReview --> ViewDetail : Submit success\nor cancel

ViewDetail --> EditReview : Edit own review\n(if author)

EditReview : - Update form\n- Change rating/comment

EditReview --> ViewDetail : Update success

EditListing : - Edit form\nfor listing

EditListing --> ViewDetail : Update success\nor cancel

CreateListing : - Multi-step form\n- Fill details\n- GPS + Images\n- Route builder

CreateListing --> ViewListings : Submit\nsuccess

CreateListing --> Home : Cancel\n(form saved)

Home --> CreateListing : Click\n"New Listing"

@enduml
